{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Can you make your great escape without the boss catching you?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>Exit Strategy</i>, you're a office worker looking for the ultimate clock-out: escaping early without getting caught. Use stealth, clever distractions, and your environment to outsmart your boss and find your way to freedom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd0d Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Stealth Puzzle Gameplay</strong>: Slip past supervisors, duck into vents, distract coworkers, and escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Steam Workshop Support</strong>: Build your own custom maps and share them with the community.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uddc2\ufe0f <strong>Office-Themed Mayhem</strong>: Navigate copy rooms, cubicles, break rooms, and boss offices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Community Challenges (PLANNED but NOT IMPLEMENTED YET)</strong>: Compete on leaderboards and beat the trickiest user-created maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcbc <strong>Multiple Escape Routes</strong>: Every map has creative paths\u2014find the fastest or the weirdest one!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're hiding under desks, in a paper box or knocking over the water cooler to create a distraction, every level is a mini sandbox.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3692530?t=1746309136","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692530/c4d313552aac855a1b0253c507affb880ee9e554/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746309136","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692530/7e177023e9e076b30330e1839e2546695f082728/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746309136","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3692530/7e177